                        ["As long as the Hourglass of Fate is with thee, if thou art killed, thou shalt be resurrected on Monk Isle."];
                        ["And if one of thy companions is killed, thou canst summon one of us to resurrect him or her, by use of the Hourglass."];
                        ["The monk shall come soon, when thou art in a safe place, without strangers or distractions."];
                    }
