                        TurnOff("foretold");
                        ["I am a Xenkan monk, my <v2>. As such, I have devoted my life to studying the prophecies of Xenka."];
                        ["The writings are clear: the Hero shall come in the last days, with Three Companions, to battle against the Evil which is in the land."];
