                        ["They shall be thine oldest and most trusted friends, and it is their part to share thine adventure with thee."];
                        ["Thou must find them, Hero! And then never let them leave thy side..."];
                        flag(707) = true;
                    }
                    key ("Power") {
                        TurnOff("Power");
                        ["The writings are vague on this point, so that it is not certain whether the Power lives in the Void now, or merely came from that place."];
                        ["However, I know that thou shalt need to seek out three artifacts -- a Ring, a Necklace, and an Earring."];
                        ["Through these ancient items, the Power shall communicate with thee. More than this, I know not."];
                        flag(706) = true;
                    }
                    key ("Xenka") {
